										<img height="283" src="img/genn_tannsuigyo2_kai052_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/yujin/tannsuigyo2_kai/img/genn_tannsuigyo2_kai052.jpg" --></a></td><td>
